            "review_title": "Review at Cỏ Garden",
            "review_text": "Fearless61835608423\n1 contribution\n0\nReflects service quality\nJan 2024 • Friends\nHaving a New Year's Eve meal on January 15 at the restaurant, I received a voucher for 2 fried pomfret fish. Contacted the shop to ask if it was still valid to use today, January 31st, but the shop said it would be effective from the 16th so it could still be used. When I went to the shop, they said it was expired and I could not use it, the shop was busy 2 3 sorry, wasted time coming from far away, never stopping by again\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten January 31, 2024",
