            "review_title": "Review at Cỏ Garden",
            "review_text": "MylanroseNguyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam242 contributions\n0\nNice Place to Celebrate A Birthday.\nNov 2020 • Friends\nI've been here twice. First time, i was with my family. Second time, i've been here to celebrate my daughter's birthday. The restaurant is new & very beautiful. Food is good & very nice decorating. Example you can try \" Fried goby fish and tamarin sauce\". \" Geoduck sashimi \". \" Tiger prawns with Thai sauce ( red or green )\"... Service is great. My daughter had a wonderful birthday's celebration here. The place is good for friends, who want to have nice food & good atmosphere. Will come here again sometime.\nRead more\nWritten November 28, 2020",
